1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,736
You can name a conic from its equation before doing any algebra.

2
00:00:03,736 --> 00:00:05,846
Look only at the squared terms.

3
00:00:05,846 --> 00:00:08,346
Equal coefficients: a circle.

4
00:00:08,346 --> 00:00:10,716
One square missing: a parabola.

5
00:00:10,716 --> 00:00:14,192
Unequal but the same sign: an ellipse.

6
00:00:14,192 --> 00:00:17,018
Opposite signs: a hyperbola.

